I forgot to tell about relative positioning in explanation pdf. 
Assume we have an array [5,2,6,9,3,9]
Now what relative positioning guarantee is that, when two same elements are in an array.
The element that appeared first in the array will be remain relatively first to the second appeared same element in the output array.
Sometime the question comes which sorting algorithm preserves Relative positioning, so it's better to be prepared for that.
to understand more, take a copy a pen and do the dry run on the above array, by writing first element with different colour. 
The result will make you happy.
